  ('7e5aa590-8df0-518d-bcfd-b98cfa7f21bc'::uuid, '2473f4d9-844c-443e-85ee-a7834a49abb4'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://nursing.rutgers.edu/academics-admissions/graduate/dnp/anesthesia/admissions/', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'TWO separate one-page documents. (1) VERBATIM: "A Personal Statement, limited to one page*, describing a significant challenge you have faced in your academic or professional journey. How did you approach it, and what did you learn from the experience?" (2) VERBATIM: "A writing sample, limited to one page*, reflecting on an unusual skill or a distinctive background, and explain how it influences your work, interactions, or goals." No word count is stated for either.', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('0eb7cbe5-9a3f-5370-bb77-aae7bea52ef9'::uuid, 'fef27c4e-a9a8-4dd4-82d9-92c8c218ff8f'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://www.smumn.edu/degree/doctorate/nursing-practice-in-nurse-anesthesiology-dnp/', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'One personal statement, four required elements, VERBATIM: "brief description of the applicant''s background, training, and experience"; "statement indicating the career goals of the applicant and their reasons for seeking admission to the program"; "description of the areas the applicant considers to be their strengths and areas in which the applicant wishes to develop greater strengths and abilities"; "personal information the applicant wishes to share". Plus a blinding instruction: "Please do not state any personal identifying information within the essay, as the essays are blinded for the readers to ensure a fair process." No length limit published.', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('14c18c10-c00e-50d7-862a-e112de7b8f52'::uuid, '1c5e46d1-d436-465c-9d31-c6dcaf029056'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://www.south.edu/dnp-nurse-anesthesia-admission-requirements/', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: "Personal statement (600 words max) describing the applicant''s rationale in their pursuit of a practice doctorate in nurse anesthesia and possible future roles as a CRNA."', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('544aa482-d88f-597e-99f3-667728756753'::uuid, 'b50d5e09-9870-4708-916b-e8b5e4aa44dc'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://www.sjf.edu/graduate-programs/doctor-of-nursing-practice-dnp/nurse-anesthetist/application-process/', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'One Professional Education Statement with SIX required elements, all verbatim: reasons for applying to the CRNA program; long- and short-term educational and professional goals and how the program will help reach them; how the degree will enhance your experience; how you plan to accommodate the rigorous curriculum alongside competing activities and doctoral study; the population you would like to focus on for your CRNA project and one clinical problem related to that population the project will help address; and how, as a doctorally prepared advanced practice nurse, you will contribute to enhancing health and quality of life for people of all cultures, economic levels and geographic locations. NO length limit of any kind is published.', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('6d7fa319-b706-50ea-9f34-309ad39b802e'::uuid, '934fc115-0094-4217-ab42-7e8a45c3da62'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://www.slhn.org/med-ed/nursing/nurse-anesthetist-crna', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: "The DNP Vision Statement is a 250 - 500 word description of the applicant''s future intentions and goals upon completion of a particular BSN-DNP track as a DNP graduate. The Statement should clearly express the applicant''s reasons for applying to the SLUHN/DSU Nurse Anesthesia Track and future professional and leadership goals as a doctorally-prepared Advanced Practice Registered Nurse."', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('235262da-d2f0-5980-989e-822d384fb3b6'::uuid, '1e61b32e-402b-4dfe-a139-39d020311838'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://nursing.osu.edu/nurseanesthesia', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: "Upload a statement describing your professional experience, career goals and alignment with the goals of the DNP Nurse Anesthesia program. Keep your statement no longer than three single-spaced pages. The statement should demonstrate your writing skills and show alignment between your goals and those of the program." Four questions must then be addressed (see detail row).', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('57e220b7-352e-5fb2-9c60-a13dfeeb815e'::uuid, '63c7be34-4f21-409c-a0a8-94372e4e60b6'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://bulletin.uakron.edu/graduate/colleges-programs/health-professions/nursing-instruction/nurse-anesthesia-dnp/', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: "300 word position paper describing professional goals and specific desire to seek graduate education at The University of Akron."', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('1624c0fb-552f-5538-b6dd-35f35e961f1d'::uuid, '02ce9071-5dc6-4aa8-998e-36a02b39fa96'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://nursing.uiowa.edu/admissions/dnp/sop', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'ONE Goal Statement, "no more than 2 pages in length", with the instruction "Please limit each response to 250 words." Required responses: (1) Purpose — "Describe why you are seeking a Doctor of Nursing Practice (DNP) degree at this point in your career."; (2) Future Contributions — "What are your long-term professional goals as a DNP-prepared nurse?"; (3) Selected Population — "Identify the population you plan to focus on during your doctoral studies." A fourth applies to dual-program applicants only: "If you are applying for a dual program, please describe your reasons for pursuing dual preparation."', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('665231d6-e086-5050-b641-333dd24287bc'::uuid, 'af651687-1b4f-4382-9270-e059a7e4ab9e'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://www.utc.edu/health-education-and-professional-studies/school-of-nursing/nurse-anesthesia/admissions', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: "Personal statement explaining your interests, motivations, and goals in pursuing a career as a CRNA". No length or formatting instruction is published. Submitted via the Graduate School Admissions site.', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('cb55cf7d-83ed-5c2f-830f-c159585a06a6'::uuid, '68095d7d-639d-4a81-a218-211eab7733de'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://nursing.utk.edu/admissions-and-aid/graduate-admissions/essay-prompts/', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'ONE essay, two prompts within it. VERBATIM: "The purpose of this three to five double-spaced page essay (MINIMUM 5000 characters - not counting spaces and MAXIMUM 18,000 characters - not counting spaces) is to provide the Admission Committee insight into your professional goals and expectations and to evaluate your written communication skills. Please address the following prompts:" then two prompts each marked (1-2 pages).', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('a2b120de-5b0b-54bb-a0d2-1095ce84f00c'::uuid, '9971c4d4-81a1-4738-95fe-e3618f37c753'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://nursing.uncg.edu/academic-programs/doctor-of-nursing-practice-dnp/nurse-anesthesia/', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: "A personal statement of 400 words or less that discusses the applicant''s nursing background and discusses future goals."', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('2f3ddc30-b90e-5eac-b1c3-629d896b4977'::uuid, 'f830ba77-425e-4f70-b4cb-7602f9f24970'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://nursing.buffalo.edu/admissions/graduate/dnp/personal-statement.html', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'ONE personal statement, "no more than 1,000 words, double-spaced and typewritten", addressing four required items plus one explicitly OPTIONAL item. All captured verbatim in the detail row. Citations are NOT required.', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('abbff745-ac83-5ce3-8b0d-96d7839f2890'::uuid, 'a317f5e8-2723-4f28-8bed-db4bda42a88b'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://nursing.uams.edu/programs/dnp/nurse-anesthesia/nurse-anesthesia-program-admissions-requirements/', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'Personal Goals Statement, VERBATIM: "The purpose of this statement is to provide the nurse anesthesia faculty further insight into the professional goals, motivation, and expectations of the applicant and to evaluate written communication skills. This statement is to be submitted with the application. Please keep statements to 250 words or less." No topic question is published — only the statement''s purpose.', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('65ec5791-fcfe-52c6-87b4-48f575bb680e'::uuid, 'd1877515-b72e-455b-ba0e-e03a8dd999d6'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://healthprofessions.udmercy.edu/academics/na/applicants/', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'Professional autobiography, VERBATIM: "A professional autobiography in essay form delineating personal goals of graduate study." Five topics, all verbatim in the detail row. Formatting: not more than 2 pages, single-spaced, 12-point Times New Roman, 1 inch margins.', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('031c35c4-5a64-57a4-ab92-910c7b135faa'::uuid, 'fcb0020c-1c6e-4338-b765-f822eca3103a'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://nursing.uic.edu/programs/doctor-nursing-practice/dnp-focus-areas/nurse-anesthesia/apply-now', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'FIVE essay questions, all captured verbatim in the detail rows. NO length limit of any kind is published — no word count, no character count, no page limit, no formatting instruction.', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('8be943c1-870b-5651-9cd3-f072c40407f1'::uuid, '55883747-34f0-4d6a-beb9-d8d887094f03'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://www.kumc.edu/school-of-health-professions/academics/departments/nurse-anesthesia-education/academics/how-to-apply.html', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: "write a statement of purpose of 500 words or less to clearly explain your future long-term goals as a nurse anesthesia provider and your hopes for contributions to the profession." Plus: "Your statement of purpose must demonstrate writing skills appropriate for graduate-level education."', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('b5d913ae-f3da-5823-9285-951cd82c892a'::uuid, '3fc6f3af-f3b0-4879-81b0-8a0a751a7709'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://www.nursing.umaryland.edu/academics/doctoral/dnp/dnp-nurse-anesthesia/', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: "Applicants are expected to submit a concise essay (no more than 350 words) addressing the following: Describe why you want to receive a Doctor in Nursing Practice degree with a Nurse Anesthesia specialty, what motivated you to seek Nurse Anesthesia as a specialty, and what your plans are following your education."', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('ac843de8-b7d1-5eed-b1b1-4cb5b3308d49'::uuid, '35795ea5-203e-46e3-a68a-514471e10ec5'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://www.sonhs.miami.edu/academics/doctoral-programs/bsn-dnp-nurse-anesthesia/admissions/index.html', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: "Discuss reasons for applying to the BSN-to-DNP Nurse Anesthesia program at the University of Miami and how it fits into personal, educational, and professional goals." No length limit is published.', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('587238f4-54c9-55f9-b60a-c2933c5baef2'::uuid, 'b5bbeb75-88be-4dd6-a235-1940b14c766b'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://www.umflint.edu/graduateprograms/anesthesia-dnap/', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: "Autobiographical Essay of 500 to 1000 words describing professional goals, health care experience, career expectations, and reason for selecting the field of anesthesia. Essays may be submitted online during the application process or emailed to FlintGradOffice@umich.edu."', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('e9ca6462-5ca0-5020-aef9-d676720980ce'::uuid, '45d2e357-0b85-4a24-9f41-82602b0a63f7'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://nursing.umn.edu/academics/doctor-nursing-practice/admissions/how-apply', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'TWO SEPARATE DOCUMENTS. (A) Personal statement, three prompts, VERBATIM limit: "There is no length requirement for each response, but please do not exceed four pages in total. The essay format should be double spaced with a 12 point font." (B) A separate Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion essay, "500 words or less".', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('291a4a79-8b47-543c-94a9-cbae3afbbb6d'::uuid, 'fd1bf91b-3b1d-42e3-81af-25ff838fdcd2'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://und.edu/programs/nurse-anesthesia-dnp/requirements.html', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'A typed personal statement, VERBATIM limit "no more than two pages in length", addressing three areas: "Describe why you have chosen the Nurse Anesthesia specialization"; "Describe your professional goals"; "Describe why you feel the University of North Dakota program is best suited to help you meet your professional goals".', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('4ad7bcb4-e405-53ac-b353-f9afc9a67011'::uuid, '5d52a945-e6b8-4c1a-88c9-33b52e351c2e'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://www.unf.edu/graduateschool/academics/programs/nurse-anesthesiology.html', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: "Personal statement of 500 words or fewer" describing "one''s purpose in seeking admission to the CRNA program and preparations made for such academic studies."', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('9b9390aa-f8d8-5ad4-84c7-7ebf9fc8bc43'::uuid, 'e002f169-86d0-4502-b102-0eb01a432f82'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://sc.edu/study/colleges_schools/medicine/education/nurse_anesthesia/admission_and_application/index.php', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM, and identical on two independent official pages: "Personal Statement on why you have chosen to become a CRNA." No word limit, no page limit, no formatting requirement is published anywhere.', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('b6e3cde7-ac51-53ee-be99-9090ae499598'::uuid, '807bbef6-7fab-487c-9f73-1494471d2ee2'::uuid, null, 'needs-review', 'https://catalog.usd.edu/preview_entity.php?catoid=41&ent_oid=2389', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM, from the official Graduate Catalog admission requirements for Nurse Anesthesia Practice: "A written 500 word statement to address advanced practice professional goals." That single sentence is the entire published instruction.', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('65852260-a8e5-5b81-82a6-43619def50bb'::uuid, 'b1f94e7d-8783-4ea9-85db-43700d08f03a'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://crna.usc.edu/Application.aspx', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'TWO SEPARATE REQUIRED STATEMENTS, VERBATIM: (1) "Reflect on a moment when you recognized the limits of your current role and felt compelled to pursue nurse anesthesia. What specifically prepared you for this transition?" (2) "Provide an example of when you advocated for a patient or safety concern, particularly when doing so challenged existing practice or hierarchy." Limit: "maximum of 500 words for EACH question"; "Both statements are required".', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('dbf4fa7c-33b8-5b9f-899b-0bc4a3f292c9'::uuid, 'c37c5c06-fa01-40c0-8415-93be4f01daeb'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://www.usm.edu/leadership-advanced-nursing-practice/nurse_anesthesia_additional_information/nap_faqs.php', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: "Submit a Personal Statement as prompted in your application. You should address: you have chosen nurse anesthesia as a career, your personal/professional accomplishments, your strengths and weaknesses, and your short/long range professional goals. The essay is limited to two pages double-spaced. (Times Roman or Arial 11 or 12 font size). Only the first two pages will be read if your essay goes over the limit."', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('6f0ba679-41b0-5114-b8e8-76a171735616'::uuid, '6c0d2dc4-9d72-4165-8423-a313bbfe7956'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://nursing.uth.edu/programs/dnp/nurse-anesthesia/admission-requirements', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: "A 500-word statement describing your area of practice interest, career goals, and reasons for desiring doctoral study." That is the whole published instruction.', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('b9b7d288-e1e7-5609-aea4-1e9c2af22a68'::uuid, '227938fe-c74e-4aa0-9e32-c6e9f885cc57'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://www.ursuline.edu/academics/programs/dnp-nurse-anesthesia/admission', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: an "essay of less than 500 words" answering "Describe how you have prepared for an advanced practice role as a nurse anesthetist and how you see yourself contributing to the profession."', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('65beed5f-3402-585c-8d17-72afb695d29e'::uuid, '5a43b08e-5694-42ef-b0f5-0903701209ca'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://www.villanova.edu/university/nursing/academic-programs/doctoral/doctor-nursing-practice/nurse-anesthesia-track/admission.html', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: "A personal statement identifying career goals that are congruent with the objectives of the program and demonstrate professional communication and writing skills." No word limit, page limit or formatting instruction is published.', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('deef88ab-a1da-584a-957c-3be15f4fe303'::uuid, 'c7f83993-13af-459c-a721-4be7fb64a278'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://applebaum.wayne.edu/nurse-anesthesia/admission-requirements', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'VERBATIM: "Applicant Personal Statement a summary (1-2 pages) double-spaced highlighting your professional nursing career", which must include "reasons for desiring the nurse anesthesia profession."', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('313e9301-0245-57df-86bc-18fb89ddcdc7'::uuid, 'ee6b7156-0924-46b9-addb-6ff310962912'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://nursing.wvu.edu/admission-and-aid/graduate-programs/dnp/guidelines-on-writing-personal-statement-dnp-programs/', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'SIX required topics in one statement. VERBATIM limit: "The personal statement is limited to not more than three double spaced pages, using a legible 12 font. Grammar, punctuation, organization, and creativity will be evaluated in the scoring. Include and introduction and conclusion." Also VERBATIM: "It is absolutely imperative that you follow these guidelines and that you cover each topic area. Be clear, concise, and cogent."', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('1d21512b-4ab6-54da-8196-8f5c51d62d25'::uuid, '541ff4f3-8224-4ee8-8793-024743c310b4'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://www.ynhh.org/medical-professionals/sna', '2026-10-02'::date, true, '400-WORD MAXIMUM, confirmed on two official sources. Program page VERBATIM: "submit a narrative statement which delineates career goals, reason for pursuing the doctorate and life/work experiences and capabilities relevant to the pursuit of the advanced degree (400 word max)." Application-instructions PDF VERBATIM: "Include a personal statement outlining your motivation to pursue the career of nurse anesthesia, aptitude for the sciences, commitment to pursue the doctoral degree and any other attributes which you feel would support your candidacy for the program of study. Limit your essay to a 400-word maximum."', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0),
  ('bc685c97-f9fd-553f-8e6e-2ae87de97632'::uuid, '33e69350-7e82-430e-b94c-fcae62f03777'::uuid, null, 'verified', 'https://case.edu/nursing/admissions/how-apply/dnp', '2026-10-02'::date, true, 'Same requirement as row 10. Four essay questions, each "one typed page or less". Section on the official page is titled "Content Required for DNP Nurse Anesthesia Applications".', '[]'::jsonb, false, 0);

